# Panharmonicon doubles Spell Queller's enters ability: one exiles Bot2's Shock, the other Bot2's Lightning Bolt, both
# linked to the Queller (CR 607.2a). When it dies, Bot2 owns both and casts them as its leaves ability resolves in the order
# Bot2 chooses (CR 608.2g, 101.4c): the Bolt first, then the Shock, which resolves first - not the order they were exiled in.

